# The repository root ignores *.csv/*.json/*.pkl/*.npz and test_*. The committed
# evidence of the authoritative run is re-included explicitly so an independent
# clone can recompute every reported number (A7, A8). Only derived bulk that is
# reproducible from the pinned sources stays out: the origin-aligned snapshots
# (117 MB; hashes in prepared/manifests/outputs.json), the retained replay
# checkpoints (1 GB), the Stage 2 similarity matrices (269 MB), duplicated
# Stage 2 handoff copies and the verbose per-fold GeoRF print logs.
!tests/test_baseline.py
runs/*
!runs/fourclass-v8-20260928/
